Analysis is complete above: memory_map.hpp defines Bank2 as 26 KiB code + 14 KiB SharedMemory, while CMake LD_M4_FLASH_LEN can be larger—treat 26 KiB as the IPC-safe ceiling unless the map and both images change together. M0 heap ends at AHB end − 10 KiB matching m0_external_app_runtime. Meteor adds ~32 KiB M4 .bss soft buffers, lazy M4 heap for interleaved post, and M0 heap for deint + MsumrDemux. SPI m4_init LZ4 has no output-size guard in core_control.cpp. Use CI/map checks and explicit alloc failure UI for stable bring-up.